        "is_discontinued": false,
        "description": "<p>Bosch 2-Rack 100 Series dishwashers deliver a clean and dry you can rely on, plus extra flexibility when you need it. The redesigned, edge-to-edge recessed handle with integrated front controls blend functionality and beauty. With PrecisionWash, intelligent sensors continually scan and check the progress of dishes throughout the cycle, while powerful spray arms target every item of every load, for a smarter clean. PureDry technology delivers simply clean, simply dry dishes with an energy efficient, closed drying system. Get personalized app features like Smart Cycle, hands-free voice control with Amazon Alexa or Google Home and so much more, all when you use Wi-Fi enabled Home Connect.</p><p><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Accommodates 12 place settings</li><li>Easy to use touch controls for mode selection</li><li>Comes equipped with 3 wash cycles</li><li>Interior is constructed of durable stainless steel</li><li>Quiet operation rated at 48 dB is not disruptive</li><li>The touch control panel has been simplified to offer the cycles and options you use most--all at the touch of your fingertips</li><li>Remarkably quiet operation at 48 dBA</li><li>Large interior provides ample space and flexibility for pots, pans, dishes, &amp; more</li><li>Offers 5 standard wash cycles, including the following: Heavy, Auto, Normal, Speed60, Favorite, and 3 standard options, including: Sanitize, Remote Start, and Extra Dry. Plus, the ability to access additional wash cycles and options though Home Connect such as Delay Start, Delicate, Machine Care, and more</li><li>Beautiful stainless steel interior</li><li>Precisely engineered detergent tray holds detergent tabs in place for a dedicated spray jet to directly dissolve them, preventing buildup for a deeper clean</li><li>Includes two lower rack silverware baskets</li><li>Covered under 1 year limited parts and labor and 30 day cosmetic manufacturer warranties</li></ul><p><strong>Product Technologies:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>PureDry: </strong>Bosch's energy efficient drying system allows you to safely place plastics anywhere, even on the bottom rack, without fear of melting</li></ul><ul><li><strong>PrecisionWash®: </strong>Uses Intelligent sensors to monitor the wash water and automatically adjust the cycle for a smarter clean</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Home Connect® App: </strong>Access additional wash cycles to choose the right one for your needs with Smart Cycle</li></ul><ul><li><strong>24/7 AquaStop®: </strong>Premium leak protection system contains leaks through a precisely engineered tub and dual sensor system</li></ul><p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><ul><li>Place Setting Capacity: 12</li><li>Number of Cycles: 3</li><li>Number of Racks: 2</li><li>Control Type: Touch</li><li>dB Rating: 48</li><li>Depth: 23-3/4\"</li><li>Height: 33-7/8\"</li><li>Width: 23-9/16\"</li><li>Amperage: 12A</li><li>Voltage: 120V</li></ul>",
