    "Product_Description_Web_Retailer": "Bosch 2-Rack 100 Series dishwashers deliver a clean and dry you can rely on, plus extra flexibility when you need it. The redesigned, edge-to-edge recessed handle with integrated front controls blend functionality and beauty. With PrecisionWash, intelligent sensors continually scan and check the progress of dishes throughout the cycle, while powerful spray arms target every item of every load, for a smarter clean. PureDry technology delivers simply clean, simply dry dishes with an energy efficient, closed drying system. Get personalized app features like Smart Cycle, hands-free voice control with Amazon Alexa or Google Home and so much more, all when you use Wi-Fi enabled Home Connect.",
    "Features_Web_Retailer": "<ul><li>A smarter clean with PrecisionWash(R)</li><li>Not just dry, but PureDry(R)</li><li>48 dBA -- the quietest dishwasher brand in the U.S.*</li><li>Prevent leaks with AquaStop(R)</li><li>Favourite programme: personalized function by just one touch.</li><li>ExtraDry: selectable option for additional drying.</li><li>Enhance your cleaning experience with Wi-Fi enabled Home Connect(R)</li><li>10-Year Rust-Through Warranty.</li><li>Anti-fingerprint Stainless Steel doors</li><li>Auto Program: automatically the best cleaning performance.</li><li>The dishwasher that removes more than food.</li><li>Your appliance listens to you.</li><li>Enhance your cleaning experience with Wi-Fi enabled Home Connect.</li><li>Programme Assistant - The right programme for each load.</li><li>Download programmes to match your everyday life.</li></ul>",
